### 세금 계산
POST {{baseUrl}}/tax/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "taxYear": 2025,
  "prepaidTax": 500000,
  "deductions": {
    "국민연금": 1200000,
    "건강보험": 800000,
    "개인연금": 4000000
  }
}

### 절세 현황 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/tax/savings?taxYear=2025
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
